# TypeScript incremental build cache — a local artifact, not source. Now that
# `npm run check` typechecks studio/ too, every check would otherwise dirty it.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Probe output. The screenshots worth keeping are copied into docs/evidence/
# deliberately; the rest is one local run's scratch.
artifacts/

# Generated by `npm run mascot:preview` — a look at the character engine, not source.
.mascot-preview.html
.mascot-motion.mp4

# The performance lab's raw runs (scripts/perf-lab.mjs); the tables that
# matter are copied into docs/PERFORMANCE_LOG.md.
scratchpad/

# Supplier price captures (Tmall, the Bambu Lab EU and US stores) and the v1
# files made from them (scripts/supplier-prices/): the shop's cost basis. They
# are uploaded through the owner's door, never committed (docs/SMART_PRICING.md
# §3.3, owner question 282(g)). The few records the tests need are copied into
# tests/fixtures/supplierPrices/ and tests/fixtures/supplierPricePages/.
data/bambu-*-prices/
